君に魔法をかけるよ 逃げ出せるモヤを
I'll cast a spell on you to chase away the haze you can't escape...

309
00:50:09,058 --> 00:50:11,398
始まりを告げる 衝動が響く
The impulse announcing the beginning echoes forth.

310
00:50:11,638 --> 00:50:14,238
気づいたときには いつの間にか
By the time I noticed, before I knew it,

311
00:50:14,238 --> 00:50:16,738
スタートラインなんて 何ものでもなかった
even a starting line... things that were nothing at all

312
00:50:16,738 --> 00:50:19,298
日々を越えたのは 見つけたばかりの
were surpassed by the tiny light

313
00:50:19,298 --> 00:50:21,798
ちっぽけな光 輝きの軌跡
I had just found—the trajectory of radiance.

314
00:51:44,438 --> 00:51:49,938
君に魔法をかけるよ 逃げ出せるモヤを
I'll cast a spell on you to chase away the haze...

315
00:51:50,138 --> 00:51:52,818
始まりを告げる 衝動が響く
The impulse announcing the beginning echoes forth.

316
00:51:53,018 --> 00:51:55,618
スイートマジック
Sweet Magic

317
00:51:55,618 --> 00:51:58,518
ベテルギウス
Betelgeuse

318
00:51:58,518 --> 00:52:01,418
愛して愛して愛して
Ai Shite Ai Shite Ai Shite

319
00:52:01,418 --> 00:52:04,018
アドベンチャー
Adventure

320
00:52:04,018 --> 00:52:11,218
On your side 気づいたときがスタートラインなんだ
On your side—the moment you realize it is the starting line.

321
00:52:11,218 --> 00:52:14,718
何ものでもなかった日々を越えたのは
What surpassed those days when I was nothing at all

322
00:52:14,718 --> 00:52:18,018
見つけたばかりのちっぽけな輝き
was the tiny radiance I just found.

323
00:52:18,018 --> 00:52:25,218
どうして私だけうまくいかないんだろう
Why is it that only things don't go well for me?

324
00:52:25,218 --> 00:52:34,718
すべてがうまくいくわけないけど君に見つけてほしくて
Not everything goes right, but I wanted you to find me.

325
00:52:34,718 --> 00:52:38,718
なりたい私になる 夢があるから
Because I have a dream of becoming the me I want to be.

326
00:52:46,669 --> 00:52:50,469
飛び出そうよ いま すぐに
Let's fly out right now!

327
00:52:50,469 --> 00:52:53,569
育みたい 掴みたい 夢があるから
Because I have a dream I want to nurture, I want to grasp!

328
00:52:53,569 --> 00:52:59,569
踏み込んだ日々のことも 全て踏み出すんだ
Stepping into those days as well, stepping forward through it all!

329
